			"text": "Commander think tick median = 3.458 ms over 33 ticks (step memory). The worst step is `memory` in commander.gd `_think()`: cap its work per tick (a budget in usec, continue next tick), cache its group scans (AIWorldCache, ai-2v2.md:336), and move one-time setup / resource loads out of the first ticks. Commander counters: rule_usec_max / rule_usec_max_at say when it spiked.",
