			"title": "Pool the VFX"
		},
		{
			"rank": 104.3896,
			"source": "hot list: `scripts/units/unit.gd`",
			"text": "4.390 ms / frame over 224 nodes. shader parameter write (unit.gd:1948 in `_update_hp_bar()`, unit.gd:1949 in `_update_hp_bar()`). Fix: write only when the value changes (compare first) or move the animation into the shader (TIME). `scripts/units/unit.gd` `_physics_process`: run target acquisition / aggro scans every 0.2-0.3 s with a per-unit offset instead of every frame, use a spatial hash for nearest-enemy, and skip idle units.",
			"title": "Cheaper unit ticks"
		},
		{
			"rank": 101.2412,
			"source": "hot list: `scripts/ui/selection_panel.gd`",
